d-only ../c_src/build/libzstd.so | grep NAME`; read exact signatures + struct layouts from c_src/src/include/zdict.h and c_src/src/dictBuilder/cover.h):\n- ZDICT_trainFromBuffer(dictBuffer, dictBufferCapacity, samplesBuffer, samplesSizes, nbSamples)\n- ZDICT_trainFromBuffer_cover(..., ZDICT_cover_params_t) and ZDICT_optimizeTrainFromBuffer_cover(..., *mut ZDICT_cover_params_t) — ALSO compare the params struct written back by the optimize variants\n- ZDICT_trainFromBuffer_fastCover(..., ZDICT_fastCover_params_t), ZDICT_optimizeTrainFromBuffer_fastCover(..., *mut ...)\n- ZDICT_trainFromBuffer_legacy(..., ZDICT_legacy_params_t)\n- ZDICT_finalizeDictionary(dstDictBuffer, maxDictSize, dictContent, dictContentSize, samplesBuffer, samplesSizes, nbSamples, ZDICT_params_t)\n- ZDICT_addEntropyTablesFromBuffer, ZDICT_getDictID, ZDICT_getDictHeaderSize, ZDICT_isError, ZDICT_getErrorName (compare the C strings)\n- COVER_computeEpochs, COVER_sum, COVER_best_init/start/wait/finish/destroy, COVER_selectDict, COVER_checkTotalCompressedSize, COVER_dictSelectionError/Free/IsError, COVER_warnOnSmallCorpus, divsufsort, divbwt (signatures in cover.h / divsufsort.h). For `dictb_cover_internals` at minimum exercise COVER_computeEpochs (maxDictSize ∈ {256,8192} × nbDmers × k × passes ∈ {1,4}), COVER_sum, and divsufsort/divbwt on 4096 B text and 4096 B all-zero input (compare the whole output arrays).\n\nCRITICAL correctness notes:\n- `ZDICT_params_t.dictID == 0` makes the C code choose a RANDOM dictID, so output is nondeterministic. ALWAYS pin dictID to a non-zero constant (e.g. 1, 12345, 0x80000001) when comparing bytes. You may still test dictID=0 but then only compare return values, not bytes.\n- Keep `notificationLevel = 0` to avoid stderr noise.\n- Parameter ranges/limits to sweep: cover k ∈ {16,50,200,1000,2048}, d ∈ {6,8,16} (d<=k), splitPoint ∈ {0.0(→1.0),0.5,0.75,1.0}, shrinkDict ∈ {0,1}, shrinkDictMaxRegression ∈ {0,1,5}, steps ∈ {0(→40),1,4,8}, nbThreads ∈ {1,4}; fastCover f ∈ {0